HOW THE CLUB IS RUN:
- Money collector: Davide
- Match fee: not set
- Teams are made: when an organiser asks
- Who posts the squad list: MatchTime
- Who fills an open place: the first on the bench moves up
- Man of the Match is chosen by: the players' vote
- Scores: a game's score is reported in the group, by someone who played in it or an admin tagging MatchTime after the game; never by private message.
- The squad is a MONTHLY squad: the regulars who paid for the month are on the month's list and in every game of the month without saying anything, so nobody needs to confirm.
- A regular who can't make a game says OUT, and their place opens for that game.
- An open place goes to the bench first, then to the pay as you go players: one says IN to take it and pays for that game only.
- The month's list starts from the list the organisers post for the month.
- While places are open, MatchTime posts the month's list with a call for players at 17:00 in the players' group, until the drop-out deadline.
- Partner clubs (clubs that lend each other players when short): none
- MatchTime player pool (nearby players who joined it): off

